    "enUS": {
      "description": "Have you noticed the puny centaur stomping about around here? Those are of Gelkis descent.\r\n\r\nWe Magram have already established a foothold deeper into the canyon. When the Gelkis took notice of our presence here, some among them chose to follow in our footsteps. I know not whether they wish to join us or attempt to overthrow us, but I do know that their clanmates have sentenced them all to exile.\r\n\r\nThey're lone wolves meddling in powers that do not belong to them. I want them dead.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Outcast Necromancer slain",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{standing} / Honored Magram Clan Centaur",
          "type": "reputation"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Maintain your reputation with the Magram, and slay Outcast Necromancers within the Valley of Bones.",
      "title": "Outcast Necromancers",
